        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Unit members who are transferred by the University to a work location more than 60 miles from the current work location shall be reimbursed for moving expenses in an amount up to one month's salary at the unit member's current rate of pay. Exceptions shall be as provided in University Regulation 05.02.06. The University shall give at least six (6) months' advance notice to any unit member whom it intends to transfer.",
